cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Renewal kinetics: exact and Monte Carlo models of SO2 oxidation on a self renewing copper oxide surface"
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Exact master equation and kinetic Monte Carlo models of SO2 oxidation on a
  copper oxide surface that sulphates in service and recovers by exposing fresh
  copper. Includes two results that hold for every positive assignment of rate
  constants: a minimum active patch size of three sites under a dual site
  adsorption mechanism, and an exact bound on product recovered per copper atom
  consumed. The reaction barriers are illustrative and the work has not been
  validated against experiment.
keywords:
  - kinetic Monte Carlo
  - heterogeneous catalysis
  - catalyst deactivation
  - sulphation
  - copper oxide
  - master equation
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Gaur
    given-names: Pragyaan
